  "name": "EU Environment Sub-Committee",
  "parent_committee_id": 176,
  "purpose": "<p>The Sub-Committee examines EU policy on agriculture, energy, climate change, the environment, food, fisheries, biosecurity and public health. It also considers the environmental aspects of the UK-EU level playing field.</p>\r\n<p>This Committee is a Sub-Committee of the <a href=\"https://committees.parliament.uk/committee/176/european-union-committee/\">European Union Select Committee</a></p>\r\n<p>Follow the European Union Committee on <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LordsEUCom\">Twitter</a></p>",
